From: HDSatelit <dev@hdsatelit.local>
Subject: [PATCH] JSC: omit the DFG cache alternative in baseline-only builds

The DFG cache type is incomplete and its visitors are excluded without
DFG_JIT. Exclude its variant alternative too, so the baseline-only visitor
is exhaustive and templates do not instantiate access to a missing type.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
diff --git a/Source/JavaScriptCore/jit/JITInlineCacheGenerator.h b/Source/JavaScriptCore/jit/JITInlineCacheGenerator.h
--- a/Source/JavaScriptCore/jit/JITInlineCacheGenerator.h
+++ b/Source/JavaScriptCore/jit/JITInlineCacheGenerator.h
@@ -55,7 +55,11 @@
 enum class CacheType : int8_t;
 enum class JITType : uint8_t;
 
-using CompileTimePropertyInlineCache = Variant<PropertyInlineCache*, BaselineUnlinkedPropertyInlineCache*, DFG::UnlinkedPropertyInlineCache*>;
+using CompileTimePropertyInlineCache = Variant<PropertyInlineCache*, BaselineUnlinkedPropertyInlineCache*
+#if ENABLE(DFG_JIT)
+    , DFG::UnlinkedPropertyInlineCache*
+#endif
+    >;
 
 class JITInlineCacheGenerator {
 protected:
